@startuml feedback_cycle
title 階段式即時回饋學習循環圖

skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 25
  FontSize 14
}

skinparam arrow {
  Color #334155
  Thickness 2
}

rectangle "學習者\n進行滲透測試攻擊" as A #E0F2FE
rectangle "防禦監控系統\n即時偵測攻擊階段" as B #FEF3C7
rectangle "驅動 LED\n階段式燈號回饋" as C #FEE2E2
rectangle "學習者\n觀察設備物理反應" as D #E0F2FE
rectangle "確認攻擊成效\n提升成就感與學習動機" as E #DCFCE7

A -right-> B
B -right-> C
C -down-> D
D -left-> E
E -left-> A

center footer 本循環於每一攻擊階段重複執行，直至所有階段完成

@enduml
